<p>This page covers the one-way transfer from Marbella to Granada for travelers relocating between the two as part of a longer Spain trip, not a same-day round-trip excursion. The fare is agreed in advance, luggage is handled at both ends by the driver, and pickup can be arranged from anywhere along the Marbella coastline, including Puerto Banús, San Pedro de Alcántara, or the Golden Mile.</p>
